'''Castle Guard''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked during the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]] by completing the stage [[Because I'm Human]] with a [[Timed Score Reward|Timed Score]] of at least 4,500. He was added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]]. [[True Form]] also added in Version 4.6 increases [[Strengthen]] damage from +50% to +150%.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 249
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Castle Guard
|name2 = Sailor Swordsman
|name3 = Wise Swordsman
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Sailor Swordsman''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Wise Swordsman''' when obtained from [[Road to Swordsman Evolution (Easy)|Road to Swordsman Evolution]] and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
Very similar to [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] in terms of usage. Cheap and expendable, it can be summoned en masse to take hits in place of other, more important units. This meatshield role is quite valuable, if not for the wide selection of Cats able to perform it without relevant differences in quality. Swordsman, however, can be used in {{4c}} and [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event#Castle Dragon VS Castle Dragon|Castle Dragon VS Castle Dragon]] stages, where there is considerably less competition.

==='''True Form'''===
Wise Swordsman gets his Strengthen power tripled. This changes nothing about him. Most enemies will kill him in one hit, and those weak enough not to are not threats.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

